2013 ez a szab\u00e1ly a kiv\u00e1lasztott t\u00edpus minden blokkj\u00e1ra \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes."],"Attribute":["Attrib\u00fatum"],"Custom attribute name":["Egy\u00e9ni attrib\u00fatumn\u00e9v"],"e.g. h1,h2,h3":["pl. h1,h2,h3"],"No control sets selected":["Nincs kiv\u00e1lasztva vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szlet"],"Add\u2026":["Hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1s\u2026"],"Missing control set #%d":["Hi\u00e1nyz\u00f3 vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szlet #%d"],"Move up":["Feljebb mozgat\u00e1s"],"Move down":["Lejjebb mozgat\u00e1s"],"Add control set":["Vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szlet hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"Change status (currently %s)":["\u00c1llapot m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sa (jelenleg: %s)"],"Rule label":["Szab\u00e1lyc\u00edmke"],"Block type":["Blokkt\u00edpus"],"Select a block type":["V\u00e1lasszon egy blokkt\u00edpust"],"This block does not support the selected access mode.":["Ez a blokk nem t\u00e1mogatja a kiv\u00e1lasztott hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9si m\u00f3dot."],"Mode":["M\u00f3d"],"Rule mode":["Szab\u00e1lym\u00f3d"],"Remove rule":["Szab\u00e1ly elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1sa"],"Access profile":["Hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9si profil"],"Define the editing experience for selected roles and post types.":["Hat\u00e1rozza meg a kiv\u00e1lasztott szerepk\u00f6r\u00f6k \u00e9s bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok szerkeszt\u00e9si \u00e9lm\u00e9ny\u00e9t."],"Rules refine access block by block. Unmatched blocks use the fallback mode.":["A szab\u00e1lyok blokkonk\u00e9nt pontos\u00edtj\u00e1k a hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9st. A nem illeszked\u0151 blokkokra a tartal\u00e9k m\u00f3d \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes."],"Every published rule must target a block that supports the selected mode.":["Minden k\u00f6zz\u00e9tett szab\u00e1lynak olyan blokkra kell vonatkoznia, amely t\u00e1mogatja a kiv\u00e1lasztott m\u00f3dot."],"Complete or remove every condition before publishing.":["K\u00f6zz\u00e9t\u00e9tel el\u0151tt eg\u00e9sz\u00edtsen ki vagy t\u00e1vol\u00edtson el minden felt\u00e9telt."],"Choose a control set for every published custom-controls rule.":["V\u00e1lasszon vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szletet minden k\u00f6zz\u00e9tett, egy\u00e9ni vez\u00e9rl\u0151ket haszn\u00e1l\u00f3 szab\u00e1lyhoz."],"Failed to save access profile.":["A hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9si profil ment\u00e9se sikertelen."],"Profile":["Profil"],"Name this profile, choose who it applies to, and decide what happens to blocks that don\u2019t match a rule.":["Adjon nevet ennek a profilnak, v\u00e1lassza ki, kikre vonatkozzon, \u00e9s d\u00f6ntse el, mi t\u00f6rt\u00e9njen a szab\u00e1lynak nem megfelel\u0151 blokkokkal."],"e.g. Blog authors":["pl. blog szerz\u0151i"],"User roles":["Felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3i szerepk\u00f6r\u00f6k"],"Filter\u2026":["Sz\u0171r\u00e9s\u2026"],"Filter roles":["Szerepk\u00f6r\u00f6k sz\u0171r\u00e9se"],"No matches":["Nincs tal\u00e1lat"],"Post types":["Bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok"],"Filter post types":["Bejegyz\u00e9st\u00edpusok sz\u0171r\u00e9se"],"Description":["Le\u00edr\u00e1s"],"Add internal notes about this profile\u2026":["Adjon hozz\u00e1 bels\u0151 jegyzeteket ehhez a profilhoz\u2026"],"Fallback mode":["Tartal\u00e9k m\u00f3d"],"Applied to any block that doesn\u2019t match a rule below. Use <strong>Unchanged<\/strong> to leave default editor behavior intact.":["Az al\u00e1bbi szab\u00e1lyoknak nem megfelel\u0151 \u00f6sszes blokkra \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes. A <strong>v\u00e1ltozatlan<\/strong> be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1ssal megtarthatja a szerkeszt\u0151 alap\u00e9rtelmezett m\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9s\u00e9t."],"Evaluated in order. First match wins. If nothing matches, the fallback mode applies. Drag rules to reorder.":["A szab\u00e1lyok sorrendben ker\u00fclnek ki\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9sre. Az els\u0151 egyez\u00e9s \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00fcl. Ha egyik szab\u00e1ly sem illeszkedik, a tartal\u00e9k m\u00f3d l\u00e9p \u00e9rv\u00e9nybe. A szab\u00e1lyok \u00e1trendez\u00e9s\u00e9hez h\u00fazza \u0151ket."],"Add rule":["Szab\u00e1ly hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa"],"No rules yet. The fallback mode applies to every block until you add one.":["M\u00e9g nincsenek szab\u00e1lyok. Am\u00edg nem ad hozz\u00e1 szab\u00e1lyt, a tartal\u00e9k m\u00f3d minden blokkra \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes."],"Manage":["Kezel\u00e9s"],"You have unsaved changes. Discard them and leave this profile?":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak. Elveti \u0151ket, \u00e9s kil\u00e9p ebb\u0151l a profilb\u00f3l?"],"Editing permissions stay focused by role.":["A szerkeszt\u00e9si jogosults\u00e1gok szerepk\u00f6r\u00f6nk\u00e9nt kezelhet\u0151k."],"Retry":["\u00dajrapr\u00f3b\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Editor Access data couldn\u2019t be loaded. Check your connection and try again.":["Nem siker\u00fclt bet\u00f6lteni a szerkeszt\u0151i hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s adatait. Ellen\u0151rizze a kapcsolatot, majd pr\u00f3b\u00e1lja \u00fajra."],"Failed to fetch control sets.":["Nem siker\u00fclt lek\u00e9rni a vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szleteket."],"You have unsaved changes. Discard them and leave this screen?":["Nem mentett m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai vannak. Elveti \u0151ket, \u00e9s elhagyja ezt a k\u00e9perny\u0151t?"],"Control set saved.":["A vez\u00e9rl\u0151k\u00e9szlet mentve."],"Access profile saved.":["A hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9si profil mentve."]}}}